msgid ""
"Shor's algorithm for integer factorization utilizes an intermediary problem "
"known as the *order finding* problem. In this section, we demonstrate how to"
" solve the order finding problem using *quantum phase estimation*.\n"
msgstr ""
"อัลกอริทึมของ Shor "
