"techniques#pauli-twirling) for error mitigation purposes. DD involves "
"applying sequences of precisely timed control pulses to a quantum device, "
"effectively averaging out unwanted environmental interactions and "
"decoherence. Gate twirling, on the other hand, randomizes specific quantum "
